{
  "repository": "https://github.com/Mercury13/unicodia",
  "commit": "dcbe251036833331f0a8f66c186a315751db24f9",
  "scope": "Daarage supplies Tulu-Tigalari. Funky is restricted to 26 assigned Sidetic letters and 239 supplemental Latin/Cyrillic letters for script packaging and 39 general combining marks for the base lettering; uncertain-origin and weak scripts remain excluded. Archaic Cuneiform Numerals and Noto-derived Cunei supply numeric signs. BabelStone Pseudographica supplies structural and standalone non-emoji legacy symbols through the custom grid font; structural_ranges alone trigger spatial layout. Emoji and nonstandard mappings remain excluded. Historical accuracy and custom visual treatment are reviewed separately from source coverage. Noto Serif Dives Akuru and Padauk Book supply complete native script repertoires, including missing Dives letters/marks/digits and Myanmar Pao/Eastern Pwo Karen digits. Scheherazade New 4.400 supplies native Arabic Extended-C joining letters, combining marks and honorific symbols. Additional assigned Balinese, Khitan_Small_Script characters retain native shapes and spacing; custom visual and linguistic review remains provisional. Telugu and Kannada archaic SHRII signs use the standalone source drawings with light pen adaptation; they do not combine with letters (L2/22-006).",
